        "title": "Starting over, without starting over",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "With most the last two decades spent helping other companies leave their footprint, so little work had been done on my own. This meant I was starting with a blank slate. How exciting. And challenging."
          }
        ],
        "image": {
          "role": "case.screenshot",
