        "pattern": "image-fade-in",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "instant-visible"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "content.title-text",
      "content": {
        "title": "The identity must truly reflect my identity",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "I help clients build great digital products. I want to leave the legacy of a kind leader. I want to be known as a friendly visionary who helped create solutions that made a large impact on earth.",
            "highlights": [
              "great"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "But that is really hard to encapsulate in a logo mark, especially when it will need to be broken apart and used as the building blocks for the entire design system and brand experience."
          },
          {
            "text": "We put a lot of work into creating some amazing options, all modern and super clever. Some were weird (like me!). Some were classy (like me!). And this great range ultimately got us to a legendary place.",
            "highlights": [
              "legendary"
            ],
            "strong": [
              "We put a lot of work into creating some amazing options, all modern and super clever. Some were weird (like me!). Some were classy (like me!). And this great range ultimately got us to a legendary place."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "highlight": "truly"
      },
